---
# Measured, not aspirational: these skips are documented deviations.
profile: basic
exclude_paths:
  - .cache
  - dotfiles
  - holon-knowledge
skip_list:
  # Roles in this repo share one `devenv_` namespace on purpose: bootstrap resolves
  # platform facts and the alias table that every later role consumes. Galaxy's
  # "<rolename>_" prefix rule would force a private copy per role and break that.
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
  # Roles live in ansible/roles/<name>; the galaxy role-name convention adds nothing here.
  - role-name
  # README lines explaining flags are long on purpose.
  - yaml[line-length]
  # Symlinks carry no mode of their own; the roles set modes on real dirs/files.
  - risky-file-permissions
  # Bootstrap installs upstream installers (Homebrew, uv, Miniforge) by design.
  - no-changed-when
